poral-comm-ss-marii-marthae-audifacis-abachum-orations"},"publication":{"basis":"public-domain","evidence":"The wording is preexisting material of the 1962 typical edition under 17 U.S.C. 103(b), which gives a revised edition no exclusive right in material it did not contribute. The independent registered public-domain witness is the tracked 1862 Pustet text artifact. The position is settled for the repository at src/sources/inventories/missale-romanum-1962-facsimile-rights-v1.toml, which names the seasonal orations as preexisting material and requires exactly this pairing of 103(b) with a public-domain witness.","locator":"Pustet Ratisbon 1862, Tours: Mame 1922 (editio quarta iuxta typicam Vaticanam), printed p. 509; artifact PDF p. 623 (text layer, column-correct -raw extraction); artifact rights_status public-domain","source_ids":["artifact.triptych.roman-1962-latin-proper-editorial-projection.editorial-projection-2026-09-03.gap-sanctoral-1-orations-09719423","artifact.catholic-church.missale-romanum.pustet-ratisbon-1862.missale-romanum-1862-text-f34bc7cf"],"status":"permitted","surfaces":["cli","corpus-data","download","print","public-git","web"]},"reason":null,"text_sha256":"f7709aeff3e6254eb0ce96983b045c82586cadd442a98cba471c10bceb05f4a5","withheld":false},"name":"Postcommunion","source":"composed","taken_from":null,"text":"Sanctorum tuorum, Domine, intercessione placatus: praesta, quaesumus; ut,\nquae temporali celebramus actione, perpetua salvatione capiamus. Per\nDominum.\n","text_status":null,"translations":null,"unavailable_translations":null,"untranslated":[{"lang":"en","state":"unavailable","target":{"cycle":"all","extent":"body","form_id":"main","mass":"comm-ss-marii-marthae-audifacis-abachum","occurrence":1,"proper":"Postcommunion"}}]}],"registry":"1962-01-19","season":null,"takes_from":null,"text_status":null},"schema":"triptych-propers-read-mass/v1"}
